OL,3,GNEWSAPeople urged to get tested for
OL,4,Asyphilis over high rates
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in an area of Wales with some of
OL,7,Fthe highest rates of syphilis are being
OL,8,Furged to get tested for the sexually
OL,9,Ftransmitted infection.
OL,11,FSwansea Bay University Health Board has
OL,12,Fsaid it continued to see higher levels
OL,13,Fof syphilis than many other areas of
OL,14,FWales.
OL,16,FAdvanced nurse practitioner Carly
OL,17,FPorter said: "Anyone who is sexually
OL,18,Factive can be affected and we have seen
OL,19,Fcases in people aged from 17 to 70
OL,20,Fplus."
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
